<title>PORTUGAL: Funds to enter Portugal derivatives market.</title>
<headline>Funds to enter Portugal derivatives market.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's financial markets watchdog CMVM approved today a regulation allowing the entry of investment funds to the Oporto derivatives market, a CMVM source said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Council of the CMVM approved the regulation authorising investment funds to intervene in the derivatives market,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
